          "en": "That was so much fun!",
          "roman": "Mazaa aa gaya!",
          "urdu": "مزہ آ گیا!",
          "accept": [
            "maza aa gaya",
            "maza agaya"
          ],
          "kind": "phrase"
        },
        {
          "id": "p-inshallah",
